  "Step 3 of 4: P1 (blocks line, then sets) sets the ball to the net on side A, on the left, about 4.8 m high.",
  "Step 4 of 4: P2 (digs, then attacks) attacks the ball to the deep right of side B, over the net.",
  "Rotation. After each rep: P1 goes from blocks line to digs; P2 goes from digs to in line; P3 goes from next in to blocks line; P4 goes from in line to next in. The same steps then repeat with the new people.",
